  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom has a baseball game today. He gets his big blue bag. \"Is the ball in the bag?\" asks Mom. \"Yes, it is,\" says Tom. \"Are your shoes in the bag?\" \"Yes, they are.\" \"Where is your hat?\" asks Mom. Tom looks in the bag. The hat is not in the bag. \"Oh no!\" says Tom.",
      "Tom looks in the kitchen. He looks under the table. He looks behind the sofa. Pip looks too. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Lily comes to the hall. \"Where is your hat, Tom?\" asks Lily. \"I can not find it,\" says Tom. \"Look in the mirror,\" says Lily.",
      "Tom looks in the mirror. He sees his face and his eyes. He sees his two ears. He sees his head. The red hat is on his head! \"Ha ha!\" says Tom. \"Thank you, Lily!\" Mom smiles. \"Now go and play, Tom,\" she says. Pip runs with Tom to the game."
    ],
